# P12 W1-A1 (brief 3.3, Q5, Q6): an alarm rings awake: the resident ring
# screen over the menu, the beep pattern (4 x 100 ms, 1.6 s cycle), the
# "alarm ring" line once; PLAY at its release snoozes (a snooze is left):
# the PMU re-armed 9 min on and read back, alarms.dat written once.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-alarm-ring-awake.script
# golden: skip ringing snoozed     (proposed after capture C3)
# env: IPODUI_SIM_ALARM_IN=12
# Trace: alarm sim seed, alarm arm rtc=<t> ok=1, alarm ring i=0,
#        piezo play hz=2027 (piezo_hz(2000)),
#        alarm snooze how=0, alarm arm rtc=<t+540> ok=1, alarm file write
# alarm-rings: 1
# log: ipodui: alarm snooze how=0
# reset: mainmenu
wait 16000
shot ringing
key PLAY
wait 1500
shot snoozed
quit
